{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-15_end","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":232,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_main_15-15_end","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-17","storyName":"“她”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在对抗普瑞赛斯的过程中，博士、凯尔希和阿米娅竭尽全力。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_15-15_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_15-15","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":20,"next":22,"characters":["Mon3tr","普瑞赛斯","凯尔希","阿米娅","Mechanist","Logos","煌","Raidian","阿斯卡纶","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3E/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act37d0d0/m_bat_wdslm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":11},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"npc_10002","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（兴奋的咆哮）","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_npc_10002_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"charslot","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrystalroad","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":20},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"2","id":21},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr出现在你的身前，它的姿态却稍不同于往常。","id":22},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":24},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockbreakout","volume":"1","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":28},{"type":"text","text":"不用凯尔希的命令，它以迅猛的速度向敌人飞去，可一簇源石结晶拔地而起，将黑色的怪物完全包裹其中。","id":29},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"32","text":"凯尔希！当心——"}},"values":[],"id":31},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":32,"end":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你很让我惊喜，AMa-10。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你以切断自己双生循环的系统为代价来脱离我的控制，哪怕这样会使你的生命变得脆弱不堪。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"不过，你真的打算用这样的方式杀了我吗？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"我知道，在很久之前，你的意识已经与源石中的信息海洋同化。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"background","id":44},{"type":"charslot","id":45},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":46},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_50_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"image","id":52},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":53},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3E/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"在这种情况下，真正杀死你已经是不可能的事。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"但是特蕾西娅和特雷西斯做到的事，让我确信了一点。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"你对源石的控制并非无可动摇，依然存在一些手段来限制你对于源石的权限。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你所说的两个人，我的确在源石内部见过他们。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"他们的努力的确出人意料，是令人惊喜的挣扎。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"所以呢？你又如何确信，在这里杀了我不是徒劳之举？","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#1$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr攻击你的时候，你选择了防御。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......你怎么能做到？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#11$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"看来你已经察觉到了。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"基于特蕾西娅对源石的研究，同样是模仿你对Dr.{@nickname}设下的陷阱，我对你所处的唤醒室加入了一些设计。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"只要你在这里醒来，你的意识，同样会困于这具身体，而无法重新回到源石内部的信息海洋。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#3$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9E/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"或许你迟早能突破这一层限制，而且你依然有操作源石的权限，但此刻的你，也只是一个人类。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你为了反抗我，竟然会做到这一步——","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"普瑞赛斯，你不是泰拉的造物主。这片大地上的一切生命，没有义务顺应你的意愿。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......这是我对你的报复，也是最后的反抗。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"text","text":"你看到站在对面的女性脸上露出了一丝犹疑，但紧接着，源石开始在她的身旁环绕。","id":85},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_icecrystlncrse","volume":"1","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......太迟了。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"95","text":"阿米娅！帮助凯尔希！"}},"values":[],"id":94},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":95,"end":122},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_amiya_atk_01","layer":"1","id":96},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":97},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmbrek","volume":"1","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek","volume":"1","id":105},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":110},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":111},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"npc_10002","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（激昂的咆哮）","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_npc_10002_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$3","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"凯尔希医生......这一次换我来保护您......","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的法术乱流击碎了源石晶簇，Mon3tr挣脱而出，继续向唯一的目标袭去。","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"源石晶簇重新开始聚集，却已经来不及构成足以抵挡Mon3tr爪锋的屏障。","id":119},{"type":"text","text":"你看到了普瑞赛斯紧张的神情，造物主面对她的造物流露出了恐惧。","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......！","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sur","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":126},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sur","fadetime":"6","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":128},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"似乎是普瑞赛斯终于认同了她此时面临着威胁，整片甲板上的源石都开始回应她的意识而急剧滋长。","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr已经逼近了它的猎物。","id":131},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"charslot","id":136},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_bg_60_g15_rhodesabyss_off.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","id":138},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_01_l","x":"68.2","y":"13.3","rox":"73.1","roy":"5.6","roz":"-75.4","layer":"1","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","id":141},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_01_l","x":"-86.9","y":"-27.5","rox":"-74.9","roy":"-15.2","roz":"118.3","layer":"2","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_521_1#1$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mechanist","text":"右侧五名，确认瘫痪。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_521_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4133_logos_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"“殁亡”。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_4133_logos_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"charslot","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_boneflute_low","volume":"1","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#4$2","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"看上去神神道道的，结果不还是把那些我们已经打败过一次的敌人再拉出来一遍嘛，没什么大不了的。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#5$2","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"再吃我这招——","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,40","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1727_1#1$1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1728_1#1$1","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_2","volume":"1","id":171},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_1","volume":"1","id":174},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shdwblwvr","volume":"1","id":182},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#4$2","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"是我的错觉吗？这里原地产生敌人的速度好像变慢了？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#3$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"这里是PRTS的核心系统，从一开始，它就是在读取我们以往面对过的敌人的数据并复制出来。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"但是现在它读取资料库数据的速度变慢了，似乎是受到了一些阻碍......","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"看来是博士那边的行动奏效了。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿斯卡纶","text":"抓紧这个机会，一举攻破它。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3E/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿斯卡纶","text":"我们要到Abyss深处去......还有人在等着我们。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3E/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"background","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr，熔毁。","id":200},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":206},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":209},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的法术和激光轮番射向前方庞杂的源石晶簇，这样猛烈的攻势甚至压制住了源石扩张的态势。","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"直到法术的光芒淹没了普瑞赛斯的身形。","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"false","id":219},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sand_transition","layer":"3","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sand_lp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sa","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":222},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3E/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":223},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sa","fadetime":"2","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"烟尘散去后，只剩下一地的源石碎屑。","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"还有一件残破的白色外套。","id":227},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"230","text":"我们......打败她了吗？"}},"values":[],"id":229},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":230,"end":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#3$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$3","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我感受不到......任何生命的迹象，感受不到任何情绪......","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"或许......","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"情况发生得太突然，你对眼前的一系列变故都还没来得及有些实感。","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"你亲眼目睹了那个极具威胁的敌人在你面前灰飞烟灭。","id":238},{"type":"text","text":"可你没有任何松了一口气的感觉。","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"玩闹可以到此为止吗？","id":240,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_act1mainss_bat1_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act1mainss/m_act1mainss_bat1_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":242,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":243},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":244},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":248},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"250","text":"怎么回事......！"}},"values":[],"id":249},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":250,"end":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$3","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"这怎么会——","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"博士、阿米娅，后退！","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"有力的反抗，AMa-10，你的计划奏效了。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"诚如你所说，现在你们的确有杀死我的机会......","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可是，只是一个用源石塑造出的替身，就会让你如此慌张吗？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......！","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"AMa-10，我无意与你辩论你信奉的价值。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你一直以来所坚持的事，它们太渺小，我甚至无法找到一种可信的逻辑架构来评价它们的意义。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可是实验中的确会出现这样的情况，一些细小的误差，最终造成了巨大的妨碍。我不得不接受这样的结果。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我很遗憾，要将你当作这个误差来抹除。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crystalrise","volume":"1","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":271},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":272},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"普瑞赛斯抬起了手。","id":275},{"type":"text","text":"源石再次开始生长，结晶构成的尖锐的枝桠在你与阿米娅的身边密集地围绕起来，顷刻间便要将你们吞没。","id":276},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅拼尽全力用法术击碎周遭的源石，可晶簇生长的速度远为迅捷。","id":277},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#4$3","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士！躲在我身后——","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-4$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#4$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"——！","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr——","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_amiya_atk_01","layer":"1","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":296},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"这一切都在电光石火间发生。","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"你看到源石晶簇在与你近在咫尺的地方炸裂，阿米娅想要保护你，可时间不允许她作出任何反应。","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"你看到黑色怪物在这一瞬间来到了你和阿米娅的身边，用庞大且坚实的身躯挡在了你们与源石晶簇之间。","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"你看到了凯尔希......","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可惜。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"1","id":310},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":311},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":312},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":313},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrystalroad","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":315},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"0.5","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmbrek","volume":"1","id":317},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek","volume":"1","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"background","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"background","id":326},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":327},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_ac8mi_melancholic_kalts.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":328},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"50","xTo":"-50","duration":"20","block":"false","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":330},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"false","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"你会质疑自己存在的意义吗，博士？我会。","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"我很清楚自己的使命，尽管艰难，但我认同它的意义。","id":335},{"type":"text","text":"关于未来，你会有自己的答案，我只能这样坚持。","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"不用太担心我的事情，罗德岛不应当脆弱到离开了某人就无法前行。","id":337},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"我的愿望？","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"我的愿望就是守护好你和阿米娅的愿望。","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"我立下的誓言我永远不会背弃。尽管我们对守护的定义各不相同，但我会站在这里，直到最后。","id":342},{"type":"text","text":"我们无法忘怀过去，但你会有不一样的未来。","id":343},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":345},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"10","block":"false","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":347},{"type":"text","text":"我已经寻找到了自己生命的意义。","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"请带领罗德岛......","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"继续走下去吧。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"{@nickname}。","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":353},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"3","id":354},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_act1mainss_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act1mainss/m_sys_act1mainss_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":355,"musicid":2},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"4","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"image","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":359},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不知不觉，我好像已经习惯了有人在我身边来帮助我、引导我。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":360},{"type":"subtitle","text":"直到现在，我终于可以确定自己要做的事情。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":361},{"type":"subtitle","text":"无论怎样，这条路我会继续走下去。我不会放弃希望。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":362},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可是......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":363},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......你呢？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":364},{"type":"subtitle","id":365},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":366},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":367},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":368},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3E/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":369},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$3","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"凯尔希医生——！","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":376},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"378","text":"......凯尔希......？"}},"values":[],"id":377},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":378,"end":419},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"charslot","id":381},{"type":"background","id":382},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kaltswhoosh","volume":"1","id":384},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"60_i12_1_L1/60_i12_1_R1/60_i12_1_L2/60_i12_1_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-640","y":"360","fadetime":"0","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":386},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"2",